{"id":"torrey:laver-of-brass","source":"torrey","name":"Laver Of Brass","slug":"laver-of-brass","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Moses was commanded to make — Ex 30:18.","refs":[["Exod",30,18,30,18]]},{"text":"Wisdom given to Bezaleel to make — Ex 31:2,9.","refs":[["Exod",31,2,31,2],["Exod",31,9,31,9]]},{"text":"Made of brazen mirrors of the women — Ex 38:8.","refs":[["Exod",38,8,38,8]]},{"text":"Was placed in the court between the altar and the tabernacle — Ex 30:18; 40:7,30.","refs":[["Exod",30,18,30,18],["Exod",40,7,40,7],["Exod",40,30,40,30]]},{"text":"Was anointed with holy oil — Ex 40:11; Le 8:11.","refs":[["Exod",40,11,40,11],["Lev",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"Before consecration. — Ex 40:12.","refs":[["Exod",40,12,40,12]]},{"text":"Before entering the tabernacle. — Ex 30:19,20.","refs":[["Exod",30,19,30,19],["Exod",30,20,30,20]]},{"text":"Before approaching the altar. — Ex 30:20.","refs":[["Exod",30,20,30,20]]},{"text":"One made by Solomon for the temple — 1Ki 7:23-26; 2Ki 25:13.","refs":[["1Kgs",7,23,7,26],["2Kgs",25,13,25,13]]},{"text":"Called the Brazen sea — 2Ki 25:13; Jer 52:17.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,13,25,13],["Jer",52,17,52,17]]},{"text":"Christ the fountain for sin. — Zec 13:1; Re 1:5.","refs":[["Zech",13,1,13,1],["Rev",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Regeneration. — Tit 3:5; Eph 5:26.","refs":[["Titus",3,5,3,5],["Eph",5,26,5,26]]}],"refCount":21}
